flowchart LR
    A([MinIO index.md files]) --> B[Diff by ETag]
    B -->|unchanged| SK([Skip])
    B -->|added| C[Chunk & Embed]
    B -->|modified| D[Delete old chunks]
    B -->|deleted| DEL[Delete chunks]
    C --> INS[Insert into Milvus]
    D --> RE[Chunk & Embed]
    RE --> INS
    INS --> M([Milvus Collection])
    DEL --> M